Package: porelo-message-transport-matrix
Version: [[deb.version]]
Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Michael Schnell <michael@fuin.org>
Depends: porelo, porelo-message-sluice-filter, libc6 (>= [[matrix.glibc.floor]]), zlib1g (>= 1:[[matrix.zlib.floor]])
Provides: porelo-transport
Homepage: https://github.com/porelo-ai/porelo-message-matrix
Description: The Matrix transport for Porelo
 Carries messages Porelo's filter let through into a project's Matrix room,
 and brings the room's messages back into a task's mailbox. Porelo finds it
 by scanning /usr/libexec/porelo/transports/ and drives it over files.
